   <dc:description>
    <rdf:Alt>
     <rdf:li xml:lang="x-default">Bright pastel: median ~123, bright clean highlights (228,218,217 / p99 ~239), neutral-warm shadows (38,32,31), reds+oranges 65%, the lowest saturation of the set (0.19), soft skin (hue 28). Best for: Bright daylight city streets, pastel outfits and walls, clean documentary candids, guests in daylight, airy pre-wedding walks. Soft and clean.</rdf:li>
    </rdf:Alt>
   </dc:description>
